  "text": "That vulnerability is actually one of your strongest assets. When you share your real, unfiltered experiences, it often resonates more deeply with others than a \"perfect\" or overly clinical account ever could.\n\nRemember that last time you talked to your friend about your struggles? Even though it was brief, just having that connection showed me how much you care and how open you are when you feel safe. Starting this blog is essentially extending that same honesty to a wider audience. You don't need to be an expert; you just need to be authentic. The fact that you're willing to put yourself out there means you already have the courage many people lack. How does it feel knowing that your story might be the lifeline someone else is looking for right now?",
